OL,3,GNEWSAOccupation prisoner tablecloth
OL,4,Aadded to collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest addition to the Jersey
OL,7,FHeritage collection is an everyday item
OL,8,Fwhich showcases a significant piece of
OL,9,Fhistory.
OL,11,FA tablecloth embroidered by a woman
OL,12,Fimprisoned for resistance during the
OL,13,FOccupation has joined the collection.
OL,15,FIt features four women wearing
OL,16,Fcrinoline dresses and bonnets,
OL,17,Farranging flowers, and the words: Made
OL,18,Fin Jersey Prison under German
OL,19,FOccupation, July 1943. W. N. MYLNE.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
