OL,3,GNEWSAOccupation prisoner tablecloth
OL,4,Aadded to collection
OL,5,
OL,6,FA document has shown two people,
OL,7,FWinifred Nellie Mylne and her husband
OL,8,FClement Noble, were each sentenced by
OL,9,Fto a year's imprisonment and fined 300
OL,10,FReichsmarks - the official currency of
OL,11,FGermany from 1924 until 1945 - for
OL,12,Ffailing to surrender a wireless set.
